Text:
This design lists every Error of the designs of this folder.
The text that a program shows for an Error is left unspecified.

Grammar:
Error ::= messageErrorArgumentsAreNotOneMessage()                                    \
        | messageErrorNameNotAssociatedWithBase16(ProjectName,Base16)                \
        | messageErrorNameNotAssociatedWithAnyRegisteredProject(ProjectName)         \
        | messageErrorBase16NotAssociatedWithAnyRegisteredProject(Base16)            \
        | messageErrorNoInfoInFileAtBase16(Base16)                                   \
        | messageErrorPathOfBase16CanNotBeRegistered(Base16)                         \
        | messageErrorNewMetadataIsNotValid(Info)                                    \
        | messageErrorNoFearlessProjectAtPath(TaggedText)                            \
        | messageErrorProjectSameOrInsideOtherProject(TaggedText)                    \
        | messageErrorProjectIsBusy(ProjectName,Base16)                              \
        | messageErrorProjectIsNotBusy(Base16)                                       \
        | fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)                                    \
        | fearlessProjectErrorFilesChangedDuringCompile(Base16)                      \
        | fearlessProjectErrorPackageDoesNotCompile(PackageName,Str)                 \
        | fearlessProjectErrorIsNotWellShaped(Base16)                                \
        | fearlessProjectErrorPathIsInTwoPackages(FearlessPath)                      \
        | fearlessProjectErrorFearFileIsInNoPackage(FearlessPath)                    \
        | fearlessProjectErrorPackageNameIsNotValid(FearlessPath)                    \
        | fearlessProjectErrorPackageNameIsReserved(FearlessPath)                    \
        | fearlessProjectErrorRankFileNameIsNotValid(FearlessPath)                   \
        | fearlessProjectErrorPackageHasNoRankFile(PackageName)                      \
        | fearlessProjectErrorPackageHasManyRankFiles(PackageName)                   \
        | fearlessProjectErrorRankFilesAreNotValid(Str)                              \
        | fearlessProjectErrorNoMainIsSelected(Base16)                               \
        | fearlessProjectErrorSelectedMainIsNotAMain(TypeName)                       \
        | fearlessProjectErrorAttenuatedMainIsNotAMain(TypeName)                     \
        | fearlessProjectErrorAttenuatorIsNotAnAttenuator(TypeName,TypeName')        \
        | fearlessProjectErrorMountedTypeIsNotADataType(TypeName)                    \
        | fearlessProjectErrorDataTypeIsNotMounted(TypeName)                         \
        | fearlessProjectErrorIsNotOfKindCode(Base16)                                \
        | internalErrorManagerNotStarted()                                           \
        | internalErrorCanNotAddMessageToFullQueue(Message)                          \
        | internalErrorManagerIsQuitting()
